好吧  你外送  我来负责销售窗口
Okay, you deliver. I'll open the window.

171
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,900
但首先  开店宣誓
But first, business affirmation.

172
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:41,300
求你了  老天爷  别让我们被人拿枪敲到死
Please, God, don't let us get pistol-whipped in here.

173
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:50,500
不是滚娘干的就是蜘蛛侠出柜了
It's either that Guinevere or spider-man came out.

174
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:56,580
卡洛琳  我能跟你聊一件私事吗
Caroline, can I talk to you about a private matter,

175
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,620
私事就是指私处的事
by which I mean the matter is my privates.

176
00:07:59,820 --> 00:08:01,280
好  快点说  奥列格
Okay, but hurry, Oleg.

177
00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:03,300
我还得处理这"捕梦网"的事
I'm in the middle of a dream catcher situation,

178
00:08:03,300 --> 00:08:04,200
真是捕了个大噩梦
and it's a nightmare.

179
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,420
而且为啥找我聊
And why me?

180
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,860
因为我相信你  也尊敬你
'Cause I trust and respect you

181
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:11,600
而且我觉得你对处理"软脚鸡"会很有一套
And I feel like you know your way around a limp penis.

182
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,080
可能吧
Maybe.

183
00:08:17,780 --> 00:08:19,300
我跟我的心理医生说过了
I talked to my therapist--

184
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:21,280
罗伊  你懂的  那个星巴克店员
Roy, you know, down at the Starbucks.

185
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,440
他说这都是心理因素
He told me it's all mental.

186
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,260
但是我们没再深入探讨下去
We didn't get much further than that.

187
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,840
他打翻了一杯大杯咖啡到他拖鞋上
He spilled a grande mochaccino on his sandals.

188
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:31,800
你可能只是怯场
You're probably just scared.

189
00:08:32,180 --> 00:08:33,880
亲密关系对某些男人很难
Intimacy is so hard for some guys,

190
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,620
也因此害他们很难硬
it's not hard for some guys.

191
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,680
是啊  这太难懂了
Yeah, that's all over my head.

192
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:42,580
麦克斯忘了拿外送单
Oh, no, Max forgot the order slips.

193
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:44,900
奥列格  我相信会水到渠成的
Oleg, I'm sure it'll all work out.

194
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:47,240
祝你的"通心粉"早日"软硬适中"
Good luck getting your penne al dente.

195
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:50,900
还是太难懂了
Again, over my head.

196
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:57,500
麦克斯  你在干嘛
Max, what are you doing?

197
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,240
你才在干嘛咧
What are you doing?

198
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:01,400
你说我在干嘛
What am I doing?

199
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,820
我在看着你把
Well, I think I'm watching you shove

200
00:09:02,820 --> 00:09:05,140
我们的外送车塞进优步出租车里
our delivery bike into the back of an Uber car.

201
00:09:05,660 --> 00:09:07,080
这下可超级[优步]尴尬了
Well, this is uber-awkward.

202
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:10,600
快点  坐就坐  不坐就走
Come on, come on. In or out.

203
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,960
卡洛琳  他叫米利旭  拼写有个不发音的K
All right, Caroline, this is Kmilesh, with a “k.”

204
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,020
他不去机场
He doesn't go to the airport,

205
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,600
他有一次载过五月天部分成员
and he once drove some of Maroon 5--

206
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,080
所以是三月天
so Maroon 3.

207
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,400
别这样  卡洛琳
No, stop. Caroline.

208
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:24,700
如果你想我去送小蛋糕
If you want me to deliver the cupcakes,

209
00:09:24,820 --> 00:09:27,240
我不能骑车去  我得坐车去
I can't use the bike, I have to use the car.

210
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:27,920
为什么
Why?

211
00:09:28,460 --> 00:09:29,680
天啊  你怀孕了吗
Oh, my God, are you pregnant?

212
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:34,820
你每天都问我  我也几乎每天说没有
You ask me that every day, and almost every day I say no.

213
00:09:36,460 --> 00:09:39,080
我想告诉你  但这是个秘密
Look, I want to tell you, but it's a secret.

214
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,400
你不能告诉别人
And you can't tell anybody.

215
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,880
你真的觉得我会想跟任何人
Do you seriously think I would ever tell anyone

216
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,080
分享我这破生活的事吗
anything about this life?

217
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:45,980
好吧
Right.

218
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:49,140
我不知道怎么骑自行车
I don't know how to ride a bike, okay?

219
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:50,960
你不知道怎么骑自行车吗
You don't know how to ride a bike?

220
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,180
麦克斯不知道怎么骑自行车吗
Max doesn't know how to ride a bike?

221
00:09:54,180 --> 00:09:55,240
我靠  卡洛琳
Damn it, Caroline!

222
00:09:57,460 --> 00:09:59,260
麦克斯不知道怎么骑自行车
Max doesn't know how to ride a bike.

223
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:00,680
完美的一天啊
Oh, happy day.

224
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,700
我终于有强过她的事情了
I finally have something over her.

225
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,720
世上真有神
There is a God,

226
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,660
而他也正在笑麦克斯呢
and he's laughing at her too.

227
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,260
天啊  我看不下去了
Lordy, this is harder to watch

228
00:10:09,260 --> 00:10:11,480
比看金·凯瑞演的剧情片还难
than Jim Carrey in a drama.

229
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,460
麦克斯  你没睡吧
Max, are you up?

230
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:26,780
怎么有股味儿  你打包了希腊菜回家吗
What's that smell? Did you bring home greek food?

231
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,540
没  那是我的味道
No, that's me.

232
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:31,840
我身上有这股味儿是因为我骑着自行车
That's how you smell after you ride a bike

233
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:35,400
跑遍整个威廉斯堡  送了14笔小蛋糕外卖
all over Williamsburg delivering 14 orders of cupcakes,

234
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,800
而我不希望身上再有这种味道了
And I do not wish to smell like this again,

235
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:40,340
所以你一定要学会骑自行车  知道吗
so you have to learn how to ride that bike, all right?

236
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,160
你以为你是谁啊
Who do you think you are

237
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,520
带着一股鹰嘴豆泥的味冲进来
busting in here smelling like hummus

238
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:45,660
却没带鹰嘴豆泥给我吃
but having no hummus?

239
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:47,940
到底是怎么回事
What is the problem?

240
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,760
你妈难道没教过你怎么骑自行车吗
Didn't your mother ever teach you how to ride a bike?

241
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:52,700
没有  我妈忙着当公共自行车被人"骑"呢
No, my mother was too busy being the town bike.

242
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,700
那好吧  我来教你
Well, then I'll teach you.

243
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:56,360
不要  绝不骑自行车
Nope. Never getting on a bike.

244
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:57,340
这是我"三绝师太"其中一条原则
It's one of my three "nevers."

245
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,400
是啊  你第一"绝"是
Yes, well, your first "never" was,

246
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,640
"绝不跟金发妞同住"
"Never having a blonde roommate."

247
00:11:01,860 --> 00:11:04,520
小妞你一步一步似魔鬼般吞噬了我的原则啊
You are chipping away at me piece by piece, lady.

248
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:09,360
除非你告诉我原因  否则我哪儿也不去
I'm not going anywhere until you tell me what's going on.

249
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,520
我本来想坐你的床  但那是你的第三"绝"
I'd sit on your bed, but that's your third "never."

250
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:16,100
在我小的时候  有个孩子叫汤米·杜南
When I was little, there was this kid, Tommy Doonan.

251
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,480
人很乖  跳房子游戏界的一哥
Nice kid, solid hopscotcher.

252
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:22,060
每天午餐都会把他的水果卷给我
Used to give me his fruit roll-up at lunch every day.

253
00:11:22,220 --> 00:11:24,000
麦克斯  水果卷是他给你的
Max, did he give you these fruit roll-ups,

254
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,000
还是你自己抢的
or did you take them?

255
00:11:25,020 --> 00:11:25,640
别插嘴
Don't interrupt.

256
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:29,300
有一天  汤米·杜南买了一辆新的自行车
One day, Tommy Doonan got a new bike.

257
00:11:29,740 --> 00:11:31,400
他跟一位跟他长得很像
He was out front with this nice,

258
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:33,720
很亲切的老男人出来玩
older man who looked just like him.

259
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,500
你是指他的爸爸吗
You mean his dad?

260
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:38,699
应该这么称呼那人吗
Mm, is that what they call them?

261
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,000
我还以为是叫恋童怪老头呢
I assumed it was a predator.

262
00:11:41,420 --> 00:11:44,700
总而言之  我当时在嘲笑他
So anyway, I was making fun of him

263
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,760
因为他看起来很开心
'cause he seemed happy.

264
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,160
我还以为你只对我这样呢
I thought that was our thing.

265
00:11:49,340 --> 00:11:52,240
然后他开始显摆特技  前轮离地之类的
And he started showing off, doing wheelies and stuff,

266
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,320
想挫挫我的锐气
to put me in my place,

267
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:56,420
结果他从车把后面飞出去
But then he flipped up over the handlebars

268
00:11:56,420 --> 00:11:59,420
重重摔在地上  脸先着地哦
and came down hard on his face.

269
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,320
好可怜哦
Sad,

270
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:03,460
但不值得让我腋下骑出中东味儿
but not worth me having baklava pits.

271
00:12:04,580 --> 00:12:05,620
还没说完呢
Well, wait.

272
00:12:06,180 --> 00:12:07,600
我止住笑声后
After I stopped laughing

273
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:10,520
那男人把他扶起来  用恋童癖的方式拥抱他
and the man picked him up and hugged him predator-style,

274
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:15,680
我看见汤米的牙齿从脸颊冒出来
I saw Tommy's teeth had busted through his cheek.

275
00:12:16,060 --> 00:12:17,480
说白了就是
To put it plainly,

276
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:20,560
他的嘴跑到他的脸外面了
his mouth was on the outside of his face.

277
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,860
感觉就是恐怖电影里的情节
Ew, that's like something out of a horror movie,

278
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:28,460
比如《自行车活死人》或《德州自行车链杀人狂》
like Bike of the Living Dead or Texas Bike Chain Massacre

279
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:30,140
还有...算了  说够了
Or--well, that's probably enough.
